  unitName: Gunner Douglas
  unitId: 30122
  unitNumber: 159
  description: A gatling gunner who forages in the Vriksha Duchy. He lost his memory
    and was known as a visitor from another world with an unknown origin. His gatling
    gun could take down heavily armored regiments, but as Vriksha was unable to make
    ammunition, he would only be used in the most important battles. Dissatisfied
    with this, it is said he spent his days researching.
  summonDesc: This is Grand Gaia?<br>I was summoned here again?<br>It doesn't matter,
    I'll help.
  fusionDesc: Bang, bang!<br>Don't worry, I'm just<br>test firing!
